//! [usage]
Use \c{connect()} to link a signal to a slot.
The \l{Qt::QObject}{QObject} class provides the base implementation.

\note The module is loaded automatically on startup.
//! [usage]

//! [code-example]
The following snippet demonstrates the API:

\code
BADPROSE inside code block must not fire here.
QObject::connect(sender, &Sender::signal, receiver, &Receiver::slot);
\endcode

Refer to the \l{Qt documentation}{Qt docs} for more details.
//! [code-example]
